packages/scheduler/src/executor.e2e.test.ts:461 — 'expect(finalStatus.parked).toBe(false);' read back from the restarted store after the resume. `getParkStatus` derives entirely from the journal — packages/scheduler/src/parking.ts:244-247, verbatim: 'const latestAttempt = await getLatestAttemptForRun(journal, workUnitId, runId);
  if (latestAttempt === undefined || latestAttempt.status !== "parked:rate_limit") {
    return { parked: false, readyToResume: false };
  }' — so parked/not-parked at each stage IS a cold read of the journaled arc, not an in-memory flag.
